title: a same-file fixture that requests an always-skip conftest fixture carries its skip to the test
origin: #223 S5, ruling 223.Q2: the new fixture `client` requests `needs_network`, and test_total requests
origin2: `client`; pytest 9.1.1 runs test_total at base and skips it at head.
